      "text": "We organized this literature review in two subsections, one reviewing literature on destandardization by type, order, and timing, and another reviewing literature on stratification by gender, class, and race.\n\nDestandardization as Unconventional Type, Reversible Order, and Flexible Timing\n\nUnconventional Type",
